### 오늘의 상품 랭킹 (기본 page=1, size=20)
GET http://localhost:8080/api/v1/rankings
Accept: application/json

### 날짜별 상품 랭킹
GET http://localhost:8080/api/v1/rankings?date=20260717&page=1&size=20
Accept: application/json

### 상품 상세와 오늘 순위
GET http://localhost:8080/api/v1/products/1
Accept: application/json
